Domain Entity StateEducationAgency based on EducationOrganization [584]
    documentation 'This entity represents the agency of the state charged with the primary 
                  'responsibility for coordinating and supervising public instruction, including 
                  'the setting of standards for elementary and secondary instructional programs.
    shared string IdentificationCode named EducationOrganizationIdentifier [1677]
        documentation 'The identifier assigned to a StateEducationAgency.
        renames identity property EducationOrganizationIdentifier
        is queryable field
    include StateEducationAgencyAccountability [1675]
        documentation 'This entity maintains information about federal reporting and accountability 
                      'for state education agencies.
        is optional collection
    include StateEducationAgencyFederalFunds [1676]
        documentation 'Contains the information about the reception and use of federal funds for 
                      'reporting purposes.
        is optional collection